@startuml SALUD_Module_62_cross_store_consistency
title Module 62 — Outbox Projection, Reconciliation and Deletion Propagation\n(control plane: PostgreSQL consistency metadata)
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
hide circle

note as BIZ_cross_store_consistency
  BUSINESS PURPOSE
  Guarantees that derived NoSQL/search/cache/vector/object projections can be rebuilt, reconciled, repaired and deleted without dual-write inconsistency.
  All domain writes commit only to PostgreSQL plus outbox; persistent workers update secondary stores idempotently.
end note

